---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_HANDLE } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title={'About this site — ' + SITE_HANDLE} description="A project showcase and engineering notebook covering practical software, implementation decisions, and validation." /></head>
  <body class="about-page">
    <Header />
    <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="container">
      <section class="page-intro" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <h1 id="about-title">About this site.</h1>
        <p>Projects and engineering notes by {SITE_HANDLE}. A place for the work and the reasoning behind it.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="about-story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
        <div class="story-copy"><h2 id="story-title">What was built,<br />and why it works that way.</h2>
          <p>This site brings together web and Android projects, technical experiments, and notes from implementation and debugging.</p>
          <p>The project pages explain the problem, the contribution, the important decisions, and the current limits. The notes go deeper into specific engineering questions.</p>
          <p>Source code and live applications are linked where available. Screenshots illustrate the interface; validation claims describe only what was actually checked.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="site-index" aria-label="Explore this site">
          <a href="/projects"><strong>Projects</strong><span>Applications and implementation details</span></a>
          <a href="/blog"><strong>Engineering notes</strong><span>Debugging, decisions, and lessons learned</span></a>
          <a href="https://github.com/Shmily0826" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><strong>GitHub</strong><span>Public repositories by {SITE_HANDLE}</span></a>
        </aside>
      </section>
      <section class="working-section section" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
        <div class="section-title"><h2 id="principles-title">How the work is documented</h2></div>
        <div class="working-row"><h3>Start with the workflow.</h3><p>Appause adds a pause before a distracting app opens. EchoLearn connects video captions to study and review. The starting point is what should become easier for the person using the software.</p></div>
        <div class="working-row"><h3>Explain the difficult parts.</h3><p>Detection, persistence, recovery, and device behavior are part of the product. The notes describe the decisions and edge cases behind the interface.</p></div>
        <div class="working-row"><h3>Keep the evidence clear.</h3><p>AI tools are part of the development workflow. Requirements, architecture, review, debugging, and validation still need deliberate engineering decisions. Source code, local checks, and live behavior are distinct kinds of evidence.</p></div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  .about-story { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 80px; padding-block: 12px 44px; }
  .story-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3vw, 2.3rem); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .story-copy p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 64ch; }
  .site-index { align-self: start; padding: 16px 28px; background: var(--accent-soft); border-radius: 14px; }
  .site-index a { display: block; padding-block: 16px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
  .site-index a:hover strong { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .24em; }
  .site-index strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: .95rem; }
  .site-index span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; }
  .working-section { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .working-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.8fr; gap: 48px; padding-block: 20px; }
  .working-row h3 { font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .working-row p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 65ch; font-size: .94rem; margin: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .about-story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; } .site-index { padding: 12px 24px; } .working-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; } }
</style>
